  "rulesText": "You gain **+1d** to **Consort** when you gather information on a target for a score. You get **+1d** to the **engagement roll** for that operation.",
  "commentary": "Your network of underworld connections can always be leveraged to gain insight for a job—even when your contacts aren't aware that they're helping you.",
